### Recursos — actualización (SIN AUTH temporal). status se ignora.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3012/api

### PUT: method y path obligatorios -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recursos/100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/reportes",
  "description": "Reporte"
}

### PATCH parcial -> 200 (409 si el par resultante ya existe)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/recursos/100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Reporte general"
}
